CultureMech license scope
=========================

Project-authored data, including curated records, annotations, mappings and data
exports, are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC-BY-4.0). See LICENSE-DATA.

Project-authored code, including software, scripts, tests, schemas and website
templates, is licensed under BSD-3-Clause. See LICENSE-CODE.

Project-authored narrative documentation is licensed under CC-BY-4.0. For
attribution, identify CultureMech and its contributors, link to
https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureMech, retain applicable source attributions
and indicate changes.

Third-party data, images, text, vendored code and other redistributed material
retain their own licenses and notices. The project licenses apply only to
material for which the project has licensing rights; they do not replace
upstream terms.

Previously released material remains available under the licenses offered with
those releases.
